        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Awesome service. I was searching for a local place to order a warranty replacement keyboard for a Lenono Yoga laptop. I was told by Lenovo to go directly  to BestBuy an authorized service center or ICS Informatique. Glad I chose ICS. The tech took care of everything. Ordering, installation, testing, all of it. I was able to drop off the laptop and return 40 minutes later to a fixed laptop.",
